#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:1
msgid "Calibrate models"
msgstr "校准模型"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:3
msgid ""
"Use calibration data for GPTQ, AWQ, AutoRound, or another method that needs "
"representative activations. Calibrated execution uses the original "
"Transformers model definition and requires `transformers>=5,<6` plus an "
"available selected backend. Unlike the non-calibrated path, it does not "
"silently use CPU fallback when a requested accelerator is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"为 GPTQ、AWQ、AutoRound 或其他需要代表性激活的方法使用校准数据。校准执行使用原始 Transformers 模型定义，并要求 "
"`transformers>=5,<6` 以及可用的已选择后端。与非校准路径不同，当请求的加速器不可用时，它不会静默使用 CPU 回退。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:7
msgid "Before calibration, prepare:"
msgstr "校准前，请准备："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:9
msgid "a tokenizer-compatible source model directory"
msgstr "与 tokenizer 兼容的源模型目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:10
msgid ""
"a local `.txt`, `.text`, JSON, or JSONL calibration file, or a Hugging Face "
"dataset name"
msgstr "本地 `.txt`、`.text`、JSON 或 JSONL 校准文件，或 Hugging Face 数据集名称"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:11
msgid "an appropriate text column for structured data"
msgstr "适用于结构化数据的文本列"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:12
msgid "the optional `datasets` extra for a Hugging Face dataset name"
msgstr "用于 Hugging Face 数据集名称的可选 `datasets` extra"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:13
msgid "a sample count and sequence length that fit available memory"
msgstr "适合可用内存的样本数量和序列长度"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:14
msgid "an available backend and device"
msgstr "可用的后端和设备"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:15
msgid ""
"`--trust-remote-code` only when the Transformers model or tokenizer requires"
" it and you have reviewed that requirement"
msgstr "仅当 Transformers 模型或 tokenizer 需要且你已审查该要求时，才使用 `--trust-remote-code`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:17
msgid ""
"The `--trust-remote-code` flag applies to model and tokenizer loading. It "
"does not pass a trust setting to Hugging Face dataset loading."
msgstr "`--trust-remote-code` 标志适用于模型和 tokenizer 加载。它不会向 Hugging Face 数据集加载传递信任设置。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The optional `datasets` dependency is loaded only for Hugging Face dataset "
"names. Local files do not require that extra. Local text files contain one "
"non-empty sample per line. JSONL accepts a string per line or an object with"
" a text field. JSON accepts a top-level list, `{\"data\": [...]}`, or "
"`{\"text\": [...]}` (and an object whose selected text column contains the "
"records). A list or tuple of text strings is also accepted by the policy "
"interface. Empty and over-length examples are skipped."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `datasets` 依赖仅在使用 Hugging Face 数据集名称时加载。本地文件不需要该额外依赖。"
"本地文本文件每行包含一个非空样本。JSONL 接受每行一个字符串，或带有文本字段的对象。"
"JSON 接受顶层列表、`{\"data\": [...]}` 或 `{\"text\": [...]}`（以及所选文本列包含记录的对象）。"
"策略接口也接受由文本字符串组成的列表或元组。空样本和超长样本会被跳过。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:21
msgid ""
"Ready-made calibration recipes are available under `examples/recipes/`. Use "
"them as starting points, then review the model selectors, backend, and "
"calibration inputs for the target checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"现成的校准 recipes 位于 `examples/recipes/` 下。请将它们作为起点，然后针对目标 checkpoint "
"检查模型选择器、后端和校准输入。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:25
msgid "The default calibration policy is:"
msgstr "默认校准策略为："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Maximum valid samples"
msgstr "最大有效样本数"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`128`"
msgstr "`128`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Sequence length"
msgstr "序列长度"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`512`"
msgstr "`512`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`42`"
msgstr "`42`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Dataset split"
msgstr "数据集划分"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`train`"
msgstr "`train`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Text column"
msgstr "文本列"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Trust remote code"
msgstr "信任远程代码"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:36
msgid "Prepare representative data"
msgstr "准备有代表性的数据"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:38
msgid ""
"Calibration packs tokenized text into fixed-size 512-token blocks by "
"default. The packer does not split a single source sample across unrelated "
"examples. Select data that represents the target workload. For MoE models, "
"the data should route tokens through the selected experts. The "
"implementation routes selected tokens to experts, but it does not reject a "
"run merely because a corpus failed to hit every selected expert."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，校准会将分词后的文本打包为固定大小的 512-token "
"块。打包器不会将单个源样本拆分到不相关的示例中。请选择能代表目标工作负载的数据。对于 MoE 模型，数据应将 token 路由到所选专家。实现会把所选 "
"token 路由到专家，但不会仅因为语料未命中每个所选专家而拒绝运行。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:40
msgid ""
"Record the source, split, number of valid samples, sequence length, seed, "
"model revision, and backend for every run. See the [recipe "
"reference](../reference/recipes.md) for repeatable configuration."
msgstr ""
"为每次运行记录来源、划分、有效样本数、序列长度、种子、模型修订版本和后端。可复现配置请参见 [recipe "
"reference](../reference/recipes.md)。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:42
msgid "Run a local-file calibration"
msgstr "运行本地文件校准"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:63
msgid ""
"The calibration dry-run prints the plan and does not write weights. It does "
"not replace a completed calibration or runtime test."
msgstr "校准空运行会打印计划，不会写入权重。它不能替代完整校准或运行时测试。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:65
msgid "Run a dataset calibration"
msgstr "运行数据集校准"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:86
msgid ""
"Use `--trust-remote-code` only for model loading when the model or tokenizer"
" requires custom code. Review the code before enabling it."
msgstr "仅当模型或 tokenizer 加载需要自定义代码时，才为模型加载使用 `--trust-remote-code`。启用前请审查代码。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:88
msgid "Run calibrated quantization"
msgstr "运行校准量化"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:90
msgid "After the dry-run is correct, remove `--dry-run`:"
msgstr "空运行正确后，移除 `--dry-run`："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:110
msgid ""
"Source FP4 or FP8 weights are staged as BF16 before Transformers loads the "
"calibration model. In Transformers-v5 scenarios, fused experts may be "
"temporarily exposed as per-expert `nn.Linear` modules for calibration."
msgstr ""
"在 Transformers 加载校准模型之前，源 FP4 或 FP8 权重会暂存为 BF16。在 Transformers-v5 "
"场景中，融合专家可能会临时暴露为按专家划分的 `nn.Linear` 模块以便校准。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:112
msgid "Control sampling"
msgstr "控制采样"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:114
msgid "Use these options to make calibration reproducible:"
msgstr "使用这些选项让校准可复现："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`--calibration-samples`"
msgstr "`--calibration-samples`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Maximum number of valid samples"
msgstr "最大有效样本数"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`--calibration-seq-length`"
msgstr "`--calibration-seq-length`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Maximum token sequence length"
msgstr "最大 token 序列长度"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`--calibration-seed`"
msgstr "`--calibration-seed`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Sampling seed"
msgstr "采样种子"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`--calibration-split`"
msgstr "`--calibration-split`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "`--calibration-text-column`"
msgstr "`--calibration-text-column`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md
msgid "Text field for structured local data or dataset rows"
msgstr "结构化本地数据或数据集行的文本字段"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:124
msgid "Validate the result"
msgstr "验证结果"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:126
msgid "Run structural validation first:"
msgstr "先运行结构验证："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:132
msgid ""
"Native GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound exports are checked through their native "
"configuration and tensors. They do not use the compressed-tensors "
"manifest/report contract in the same way. Then run runtime loading and task-"
"level quality checks in the target inference framework."
msgstr ""
"原生 GPTQ、AWQ 和 AutoRound 导出通过其原生配置和张量进行检查。它们不会以同样方式使用 compressed-tensors "
"清单/报告契约。然后在目标推理框架中运行运行时加载和任务级质量检查。"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:134
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "回退处理"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:136
msgid "If calibration fails:"
msgstr "如果校准失败："

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:138
msgid "reduce `--calibration-samples` or `--calibration-seq-length` to fit memory"
msgstr "降低 `--calibration-samples` 或 `--calibration-seq-length` 以适配内存"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:139
msgid "verify that `--calibration-text-column` exists in structured data"
msgstr "验证结构化数据中存在 `--calibration-text-column`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:140
msgid ""
"use a small local JSONL file to separate data issues from dataset access "
"issues"
msgstr "使用小型本地 JSONL 文件来区分数据问题和数据集访问问题"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:141
msgid ""
"confirm that the selected backend is available instead of expecting "
"calibrated CPU fallback"
msgstr "确认所选后端可用，而不是期待校准式 CPU 回退"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:142
msgid "check whether the model or tokenizer requires `--trust-remote-code`"
msgstr "检查模型或 tokenizer 是否需要 `--trust-remote-code`"

#: ../../source/how-to/calibrate-models.md:143
msgid "archive the calibration command before rerunning with changed inputs"
msgstr "在使用更改后的输入重新运行之前，归档校准命令"

